    <item>
      <title>Engineering by substraction/Safety by design</title>
      <link>https://ntrospection.com/posts/safety-by-design/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://ntrospection.com/posts/safety-by-design/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;One of the things I remember most fondly from studying industrial&#xA;engineering is learning about poka-yoke: the Japanese term, coined at&#xA;Toyota, for designs that make it impossible to do the wrong thing. The&#xA;classic example is the power connector shaped so that it only fits one&#xA;way (the right one).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Picks</title>
      <link>https://ntrospection.com/picks/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 15 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://ntrospection.com/picks/</guid>
      <description>&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://ntrospection.com/picks/#books&#34;&gt;Books&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://ntrospection.com/picks/#movies-and-shows&#34;&gt;Movies and Shows&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://ntrospection.com/picks/#games&#34;&gt;Games&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://ntrospection.com/picks/#comic&#34;&gt;Comic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://ntrospection.com/picks/#places&#34;&gt;Places&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;books&#34;&gt;Books&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;kg-card kg-bookmark-card&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/24213.Alice_s_Adventures_in_Wonderland_Through_the_Looking_Glass&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external noreferrer nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9128NmYy41L._SL1500_.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-title&#34;&gt;Alice in Wonderland &amp;amp; Through the Looking-Glass&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-description&#34;&gt;When Alice sees a white rabbit take a watch out of its waistcoat pocket she decides to follow it, and a sequence of most unusual events is set in motion.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-metadata&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;kg-bookmark-author&#34;&gt;Lewis Carroll&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;kg-card kg-bookmark-card&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.goodreads.com/work/best_book/909457-neuromancer&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external noreferrer nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hnGedj5mL._SL1500_.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-title&#34;&gt;Neuromancer&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-description&#34;&gt;The Matrix is a world within the world, a global consensus hallucination, the representation of every byte of data in cyberspace.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-metadata&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;kg-bookmark-author&#34;&gt;William Gibson&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;kg-card kg-bookmark-card&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/9396305-el-camino&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external noreferrer nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MMQ4UdQ9L._AC_UF894,1000_QL80_.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-title&#34;&gt;El Camino&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-description&#34;&gt;Delibes artfully explores the process of crossing boundaries in pursuit of maturity and social advancement, whilst also implying that real education is the unfolding of the human heart among friends.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-metadata&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;kg-bookmark-author&#34;&gt;Miguel Delibes&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;kg-card kg-bookmark-card&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.goodreads.com/en/book/show/22590.Ubik&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external noreferrer nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1327995569i/22590.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-title&#34;&gt;Ubik&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-description&#34;&gt;Glen Runciter is dead... or is he? Someone died in the explosion, but even as his funeral is scheduled, his mourning employees are receiving bewildering messages from their boss.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-metadata&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;kg-bookmark-author&#34;&gt;Philip K. Dick&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;movies-and-shows&#34;&gt;Movies and Shows&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;kg-card kg-bookmark-card kg-bookmark-card-right&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-title&#34;&gt;Whiplash&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-description&#34;&gt;A promising young drummer enrolls at a cut-throat music conservatory where his dreams of greatness are mentored by an instructor who will stop at nothing.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-metadata&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;kg-bookmark-author&#34;&gt;Damien Chazelle&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.imdb.com/title/tt2582802/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external noreferrer nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQfMrzXyHwhlsfpQ4Lo69gYh2SPU_RO_3i1qgmWBALUJkEySSHc6DK7Z-SSlh3zGhsqZpJD6g&amp;amp;s=10&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;kg-card kg-bookmark-card kg-bookmark-card-right&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-title&#34;&gt;Perfect Days&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-description&#34;&gt;Hirayama cleans public toilets in Tokyo, lives his life in simplicity and daily tranquility. Some encounters also lead him to reflect on himself.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-metadata&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;kg-bookmark-author&#34;&gt;Wim Wenders, Takuma Takasaki&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.imdb.com/title/tt27503384/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external noreferrer nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTNWv8xEPJ8tzIz0o1Tpbm00cZepLsG9i2Et-6nxjd4siTwCEKnKjlzEvS5PVOMMPzbrOT2DA&amp;amp;s=10&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;kg-card kg-bookmark-card kg-bookmark-card-right&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-title&#34;&gt;Ping Pong the Animation&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-description&#34;&gt;Five ping pong prodigies learn to navigate the harsh climate of competitive sport and the even more frightening realm of self realization.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-metadata&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;kg-bookmark-author&#34;&gt;Taiyô Matsumoto&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.imdb.com/title/tt3592032/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external noreferrer nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNmYzMDRkMmYtZjNiZS00ZGVlLWI2NWQtMjc2NTE1OThmZTBiXkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;kg-card kg-bookmark-card kg-bookmark-card-right&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-title&#34;&gt;Adventure Time&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-description&#34;&gt;A 12-year-old boy and his best friend, a wise 28-year-old dog with magical powers, go on a series of surreal adventures in a remote future.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-metadata&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;kg-bookmark-author&#34;&gt;Pendleton Ward&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.imdb.com/title/tt1305826/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external noreferrer nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQFa1U2RtXuy7anNW5uBsE2XV_6RlYTIZVzVcKDm-NmWTej0xJ7dotzA_op8z5GE3yOwDu6&amp;amp;s=10&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;games&#34;&gt;Games&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;kg-card kg-bookmark-card&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a href=&#34;https://iidx.org&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external noreferrer nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://iidx.org/icon300.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-title&#34;&gt;Beatmania IIDX&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-description&#34;&gt;A real-time dance music game hard and extreme. That&amp;#39;s beatmania IIDX! It&amp;#39;s too cool! Beatmania IIDX combines the coolest songs with fun, eye-catching graphics for gameplay that keeps players coming back for more.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-metadata&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;kg-bookmark-author&#34;&gt;Konami&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;kg-card kg-bookmark-card&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a href=&#34;https://store.steampowered.com/app/3328480/TETRIS_THE_GRAND_MASTER_4_ABSOLUTE_EYE/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external noreferrer nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.arcadeclub.co.uk/cdn/game-library/tetris-the-grand-master-3-terror-instinct/480/tetris-the-grand-master-3-terror-instinct_screenshot_001_@480.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-title&#34;&gt;Tetris: The Grandmaster Series&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-description&#34;&gt;Tetris: The Grand Master is a series of puzzle arcade video games created by Arika.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-metadata&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;kg-bookmark-author&#34;&gt;Arika&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;kg-card kg-bookmark-card&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.nintendo.co.jp/n08/a3uj/index.html&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external noreferrer nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/ee/Deluxe_package.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-title&#34;&gt;Mother 3&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-description&#34;&gt;Mother 3 tells the story of Lucas, a young boy, and his friends who journey the Nowhere Islands to save the islands from an invading army and its leader.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-metadata&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;kg-bookmark-author&#34;&gt;Brownie Brown &amp;amp; HAL Laboratory&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;comic&#34;&gt;Comic&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;kg-card kg-bookmark-card kg-bookmark-card-right&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-title&#34;&gt;The Incal&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-description&#34;&gt;John Difool, a low-class detective in a degenerate dystopian world, finds his life turned upside down when he discovers an ancient, mystical artifact called &amp;#34;The Incal&amp;#34;.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-metadata&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;kg-bookmark-author&#34;&gt;Alejandro Jodorowsky, Mœbius&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.goodreads.com/en/book/show/10842223-the-incal&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external noreferrer nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1500033240i/10842223.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;kg-card kg-bookmark-card kg-bookmark-card-right&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-container&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-content&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-title&#34;&gt;Corto Maltese: The Ballad of the Salt Sea&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-description&#34;&gt;Treasure hunter, sailor, and adventurer, Corto Maltese remains one of the most popular characters from graphic literature in Europe. The story begins with Corto adrift at sea in the Pacific during World War I.&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-metadata&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;span class=&#34;kg-bookmark-author&#34;&gt;Hugo Pratt&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;kg-bookmark-thumbnail&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/12028681-corto-maltese?ref=nav_sb_ss_1_28&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external noreferrer nofollow noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1333579404i/12028681.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;places&#34;&gt;Places&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;thead&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Name&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt